@startuml activity-remove-member
title Activity: remove a member or leave a group (departure, cleanup, creator succession)\nFR-004, FR-007 to FR-011, FR-021, FR-023, FR-025, FR-026, FR-029, FR-031, FR-034, FR-036, FR-038, FR-049; NFR-001, NFR-002, NFR-006, NFR-010, NFR-011\nScenarios US2-AS3, US2-AS5, US2-AS6, US2-AS8 to US2-AS12
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam ActivityBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam ActivityBorderColor #333333

|Actor (current creator or leaving member)|
start
if (Action?) then (remove member M)
  :Current Group Creator chooses
  Remove for member M (FR-008);
else (leave)
  :Member chooses Leave; M = the actor.
  Removing oneself follows this path (FR-008);
endif
|Swing UI|
:Explain that pending work involving M will be cancelled
and, if M is the current creator, who succeeds,
allocate operation UUID, show loading (NFR-011);
|GroupService|
:CommandRunner: lock group G, open one UnitOfWork,
replay check on the operation ID (NFR-010);
if (Remove: actor is the current creator\n(including a successor) and M is active?\nLeave: actor is an active member?) then (no)
  |Swing UI|
  :Refused, nothing changes
  (FR-008, US2-AS5, NFR-002);
  stop
else (yes)
endif
|GroupService|
:BalanceCalculator.pairBalances for G from APPROVED
shares and CONFIRMED payments; outstandingFor(M);
if (Every pairwise balance of M in G = 0.00?) then (no)
  |Swing UI|
  :Refused, listing each outstanding counterparty
  and amount. A net 0.00 made of opposite debts
  to different people is still refused
  (FR-011, US2-AS3);
  stop
else (yes: settled for departure)
endif
|UnitOfWork (H2)|
:Cancel each PENDING expense in G where M is creator,
payer, participant or required approver: status CANCELLED,
shares and genuine decisions kept, EXPENSE_CANCELLED
lifecycle event with actor, reason and Clock time
(FR-025, FR-026, FR-029, US2-AS8);
note left
  Pending work alone never causes a refusal
  (FR-011, US2-AS6). APPROVED expenses and
  CONFIRMED payments are never cancelled.
end note
:Cancel each AWAITING_CONFIRMATION payment M sends or
receives in G: status CANCELLED, PAYMENT_CANCELLED event,
its reservation released (FR-036, FR-038, US2-AS9);
:Notify affected expense creators and payment parties who
remain active members, excluding the initiating actor
(EXPENSE_CANCELLED, PAYMENT_CANCELLED; FR-021);
:End M's membership (leftAt, endedBy) and append
MEMBER_REMOVED or MEMBER_LEFT (FR-049);
|GroupService|
if (Was M the current Group Creator?) then (yes)
  if (Any active member remains?) then (yes)
    |UnitOfWork (H2)|
    :currentCreatorId = remaining active member with the
    earliest current joinedAt, ties by ascending user UUID,
    originalCreatorId unchanged; CREATOR_SUCCEEDED event
    (FR-007, FR-009, US2-AS10);
  else (no: M was the last member)
    |UnitOfWork (H2)|
    :Archive G: state ARCHIVED, currentCreatorId null,
    GROUP_ARCHIVED event, history retained,
    no further member operations (US2-AS11);
  endif
else (no)
endif
|UnitOfWork (H2)|
:Save the operation result; commit everything together.
No user, expense, share, decision, payment or referenced
receipt is deleted (FR-049);
if (Commit result?) then (committed)
  |Swing UI|
  :Show DepartureResult: cancelled expenses and
  payments, successor or archived (FR-049);
  :M loses every group access path: lists, details,
  receipts, reports, old notification links (FR-004,
  FR-010, FR-023, US7-AS8). M receives only a minimal
  saved acknowledgement. Confirmed balances unchanged
  (FR-031, FR-034, US2-AS6);
  stop
elseif (Commit result?) then (failed)
  |Swing UI|
  :Any database or notification write failed: departure,
  cancellations, reservations, role change and notifications
  all roll back, access is as before, NOT_COMMITTED
  (US2-AS12, NFR-010);
  stop
else (uncertain)
  |Swing UI|
  :Outcome UNKNOWN; look up the operation ID
  before any retry (US1-AS9);
  stop
endif
@enduml
